      "content": "This expected body `{\"metadata\":null,\"data\":\"Hello World from new Server\"}` contradicts the documentation (which states metadata should be omitted when not provided) and the `omitempty` tag on the `Metadata` field. Since `v.Metadata` is a nil `map[string]any` assigned to an `interface{}` field with `omitempty`, JSON marshaling will omit it, producing `{\"data\":\"Hello World from new Server\"}`. This test expectation appears incorrect and will fail."
